        "note": "先确认是否真的需要 Skill，再冻结目标、证据和边界。"
      },
      {
        "id": "isolate",
        "label": "02 上下文隔离",
        "focus": ["requirements", "case-agent", "build-agent"],
        "note": "验收标准与候选实现隔离，sealed suite 不进入 Build Agent。"
      },
      {
        "id": "verify",
        "label": "03 质量核心",
        "focus": ["check", "run", "run-dir", "score"],
        "note": "Runner 只记录事实，Scorer 才从原始证据派生结论。"
      },
      {
        "id": "decide",
        "label": "04 决策与交付",
        "focus": ["decision", "package"],
        "note": "允许保留 baseline、支持 no-skill 或给出 inconclusive，并限制交付声明。"
      }
    ]
